  "term_and_condition": "<div style=\"font-family:Ubuntu;\"><p>To be an authorized affiliate of PurO3, you agree to abide by the terms and conditions contained in this agreement.</p><p>---</p><p>Please read this agreement carefully before registering and using the PurO3 service as an affiliate. By signing up for the PurO3 affiliate program, you indicate your acceptance of this agreement and its terms and conditions.</p><p>--- </p><p>Commission rates can be found on our affiliate program main page.  Rates are subject to change, and affiliates will be informed if they ever do. Our cookie duration is above industry standards at 90 days.</p><p>--- </p><p><strong>NOTE: </strong>United States-based affiliates will need to provide a tax ID or social security number before a payout can be made. You will be asked to fill out your W9 after approval. We must do this as the IRS requires us to file tax information for anyone we pay.  To submit your information, wait for approval, login, and go to Settings--&gt;Tax Information in your affiliate dashboard.</p><p>--- </p><p>There is a $50 threshold for payments; after an affiliate has made $50 or more they will receive store credit, direct deposit, or a payment via PayPal (depending on their preferences) on the payment date.  Commissions are paid monthly. Each commission has a 30 day pending period from the time items are delivered.  If the item is returned within that time, the commission will not be applied. </p><p>---</p><p>Affiliate payments will not apply for purchases made by the affiliate or for wholesale orders.</p><p>--- </p><p>PurO3 can create coupon codes for affiliates to assist with marketing efforts and to help track sales. PurO3 prohibits coupon codes to be displayed on coupon code websites.  If active PurO3 coupon codes are found on coupon websites, it will result in the immediate cancellation of the coupon code and will affect affiliate payout amounts. We recommend that affiliates check regularly to see if their coupon makes it on a coupon site to prevent any monetary payout issues. We also do not allow search engine remarketing like Adwords, Bing ads, Yahoo ads or similar setups that capture customers who have already found PurO3 through other means.</p><p>--- </p><p>Affiliate payments will not be applied for carts where the buyer does not follow through with payment.  In the rare instance when a buyer completes the order process but does not complete payment, affiliate fees for that order will expire and be removed.</p><p>--- </p><p>Spamming is prohibited.  Do not send out spam emails with your affiliate link or your account will be terminated.</p></div>",
